From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 23:54:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: uapi: Add a few-primitives render hint (G16
 extension)

Add DRM_ASAHI_FEATURE_FEW_PRIMITIVES and DRM_ASAHI_RENDER_FEW_PRIMITIVES.
Userspace sets the flag on render commands whose control streams submit at
most four primitives in total (every draw and instance counted), all from
draws with counts known when the command is built. G16 then selects a
faster fragment-stage tile dispatch mode, as macOS does for the same passes;
setting it for larger passes can hang the GPU.

This is a downstream extension. Downstream-only bits are allocated from
bit 30 downwards in both enums, to stay clear of upstream allocations
(which grow from the bottom) and within int range for C enums.

Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RvQieG9SGoR3ZeSdSguHnB
---
 include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h b/include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h
index b1d6d35fea77..078ce0a21248 100644
--- a/include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h
+++ b/include/uapi/drm/asahi_drm.h
@@ -220,6 +220,15 @@ enum drm_asahi_feature {
 	 * until the fragment stage.
 	 */
 	DRM_ASAHI_FEATURE_FRAGMENT_BARRIER = (1UL) << 1,
+
+	/**
+	 * @DRM_ASAHI_FEATURE_FEW_PRIMITIVES: Render commands accept
+	 * @DRM_ASAHI_RENDER_FEW_PRIMITIVES.
+	 *
+	 * Downstream (G16) extension. Downstream-only bits are allocated from
+	 * bit 30 downwards to stay clear of upstream allocations.
+	 */
+	DRM_ASAHI_FEATURE_FEW_PRIMITIVES = (1UL) << 30,
 };
 
 /**
@@ -820,6 +829,20 @@ enum drm_asahi_render_flags {
 	 * so we match that here for efficiency.
 	 */
 	DRM_ASAHI_RENDER_DBIAS_IS_INT = (1U << 18),
+
+	/**
+	 * @DRM_ASAHI_RENDER_FEW_PRIMITIVES: The render's control streams submit
+	 * at most four primitives in total, counting every draw and instance,
+	 * all from draws whose primitive counts are known when the command is
+	 * built (no indirect draws, tessellation or geometry shaders).
+	 *
+	 * This selects a faster fragment-stage tile dispatch mode for such
+	 * passes. Setting it for a larger pass can hang the GPU. Requires
+	 * @DRM_ASAHI_FEATURE_FEW_PRIMITIVES.
+	 *
+	 * Downstream (G16) extension, allocated from the top of the flag space.
+	 */
+	DRM_ASAHI_RENDER_FEW_PRIMITIVES = (1U << 30),
 };
 
